    <string name="about_back" translatable="true">Back</string>
    <string name="about_body" translatable="true">%1$s builds a swim session from your own constraints — the minutes you have, your pool length, your focus, the strokes you are leaving out and the gear on the deck — and puts a target time on every interval. Two guided pace trials, 400 m and 200 m, set the targets to your own pace, and the finished set can be shared as text or printed. One purchase opens the rest: no subscription, no account, and the app works offline.</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_note" translatable="true">One purchase, and everything you keep — sets, pace and settings — stays in the app\'s storage on your device. The only network use is Google Play\'s own billing, which carries the one-time purchase; the app computes a full set with no signal.</string>
